  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_first_00",
      "hash64": "163640F54AF83DE6",
      "text": "Hey, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_first_01",
      "hash64": "163641F54AF83F99",
      "text": "I came as quickly as I could—like I’d do any less\\nfor my best friend in the whole world![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "CB523A60EF7A8FC6",
      "text": "To be honest, I sorta just came ’cause it was you\\nwho called and all, but...man, look at this place!\\r\\nBlueberry Academy is something else![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "CB523B60EF7A9179",
      "text": "Their classes are all battle focused, right? It’s like\\na whole day full of our old battle studies classes![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "CB523860EF7A8C60",
      "text": "I’m sure Nemona would love to have gone to\\nschool in a place like this, but I’d miss having\\r\\npractical classes like home ec and stuff...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "CB523960EF7A8E13",
      "text": "If you had to choose just one subject, which do\\nyou think you’d pick? Battle studies or home ec?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "95CEA937E1C91388",
      "text": "Battle studies!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "95CEAC37E1C918A1",
      "text": "Home ec!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "CB523E60EF7A9692",
      "text": "Ah. Yeah, guess that checks out. You’re the\\nstrongest little Champ—you even beat Nemona,\\r\\nafter all...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "F756EEB6ED4E79D0",
      "text": "Yes! Knew we were two peas in a little pod, bud!\\c\\nHome ec has so many good things to teach you!\\nTry hard, and you can make the best sandwiches![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "CB523F60EF7A9845",
      "text": "Actually, Director Clavell was telling me that if I\\ndo some studying while I’m here, I’ll be able to\\r\\nget some extra credits for our school back home.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "CB523C60EF7A932C",
      "text": "I’d sorta fallen behind on that front, so I’m gonna\\nwork hard and rack up those credits![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "C6DAFC4A1C28C239",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Yo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Just the person I\\nwas\\r\\nhoping\\r\\nto\\r\\ntalk to...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "C6DAFB4A1C28C086",
      "text": "See, I’ve noticed that folks here aren’t really\\nabout the picnic and sandwich life. Is that stuff\\r\\nnot a big deal here?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "0525FB7097BB1AE5",
      "text": "You think it isn’t?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "0525F87097BB15CC",
      "text": "I’m pretty sure it is...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "C6DAFA4A1C28BED3",
      "text": "What’s that? You made a super-spicy sandwich\\nfor one of the Elite Four?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "C6DAF94A1C28BD20",
      "text": "Maybe...maybe I’m wrong, then, about people\\nhere not caring about sandwiches![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "C6DB004A1C28C905",
      "text": "See, the thing is, I was whipping up a snack in\\nthat Terarium place earlier, and these Blueberry\\r\\nkids all gathered round to watch...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "C6DAFF4A1C28C752",
      "text": "They were all staring like they’d never seen\\nanything like it! It was super embarrassing...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "C6DAFE4A1C28C59F",
      "text": "I was so flustered I ended up just making ’em all\\nsandwiches to eat too...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "0525F97097BB177F",
      "text": "That sounds nice!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "0525F67097BB1266",
      "text": "You’re sweet, Arven",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "C6DAFD4A1C28C3EC",
      "text": "It wasn’t nice at all! It was a total hassle!\\c\\nOh... I guess you mean for the kids who got to\\neat the sandwiches? Sure, nice for THEM![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_07b",
      "hash64": "0EDFF2EDD9444A4A",
      "text": "Wha—! A-am not! I’m completely sour! I just\\ncouldn’t stand the pressure of all those eyes![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "C6DB044A1C28CFD1",
      "text": "But if it’s not that unusual to make sandwiches\\naround here, then why’d they all stare like that?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "C6DB034A1C28CE1E",
      "text": "Man, I don’t know if I’m cut out for this place...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "F2E206507D92D7E8",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oh! [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! I got an update\\nfor you![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "F2E207507D92D99B",
      "text": "I solved the mystery of why your bud Arven was\\ngetting mobbed by those Blueberry kids![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F2E208507D92DB4E",
      "text": "So, apparently, the real reason they were all\\nstaring was...a case of mistaken identity![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "42657E2BDF84E362",
      "text": "How’d that come about?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "42657D2BDF84E1AF",
      "text": "Who’d they think you were?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F2E209507D92DD01",
      "text": "I don’t really know, myself...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F2E20A507D92DEB4",
      "text": "I guess some guy shows up in the Terarium every\\nso often and gives away super-spicy sandwiches?\\r\\nAnd they all thought I was him?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "F2E20B507D92E067",
      "text": "That’s why they were all being so weird, watching\\nme with...expectation, or whatever, in their eyes.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
